# VisionAI Testing Rules

- Framework: `pytest` with `httpx` (TestClient).
- Always ensure all test cases pass before merging or committing (`pytest -v`).
- Maintain coverage across:
  - Health probe (`/health`)
  - Model metadata (`/model-info`)
  - Valid image predictions (`/predict`)
  - Input validation (unsupported MIME types, empty files, file size limits)
  - Preprocessing pipeline and YOLO frame detection logic
- Add new regression tests whenever a bug fix or new endpoint is introduced.
